{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = sin(x^2)\n  ucas: diff it x\nd/dx it = 2x*cos(x^2)\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-10)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "the derivative of sin x squared with respect to x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = sin(x^2)", "diff it x"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "diff", "vars": ["x"], "order": 1, "derivative": "2x*cos(x^2)"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 201, "max_diff": 3.191712493123741e-10, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = sin(x^2)\n  ucas: diff it x\nd/dx it = 2x*cos(x^2)\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-10)\n"}, "isError": false}}
