{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 19, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2*sin(x)\n  ucas: integrate it from 0 to pi\n∫ x^2*sin(x) dx\n  = 2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x) + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [0, 3.14159] (max difference 8.9e-16)\n  from 0 to 3.14159: F(3.14159) - F(0) = 5.86960440108936\n  numeric (adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15, 15 evaluations): 5.86960440108936, estimated error 6.5e-14\n  the two agree to 0\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "what is the integral of x squared times sin x from 0 to pi", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^2*sin(x)", "integrate it from 0 to pi"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "integrate", "var": "x", "integrand": "x^2*sin(x)", "antiderivative": "2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x)", "definite": {"from": 0, "to": 3.141592653589793, "symbolic": 5.869604401089359, "numeric": 5.869604401089359, "error_estimate": 6.456564841198295e-14, "evaluations": 15, "value": 5.869604401089359}}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "derivative", "points": 401, "max_diff": 8.881784197001252e-16, "passed": true, "text": "d/dx of the antiderivative against the integrand"}, {"kind": "numeric_integral", "points": 15, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "F(b) - F(a) against adaptive Gauss-Kronrod"}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2*sin(x)\n  ucas: integrate it from 0 to pi\n∫ x^2*sin(x) dx\n  = 2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x) + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [0, 3.14159] (max difference 8.9e-16)\n  from 0 to 3.14159: F(3.14159) - F(0) = 5.86960440108936\n  numeric (adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15, 15 evaluations): 5.86960440108936, estimated error 6.5e-14\n  the two agree to 0\n"}, "isError": false}}
