{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 34, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = sin(x)/x\n  ucas: limit it x -> 0\nlimit of it as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (cos(x))/(1) = lim cos(x)\n  = 1 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 34, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "what is the limit of sin x / x as x goes to 0?", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = sin(x)/x", "limit it x -> 0"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 1, "text": "1"}}]}, "notes": [{"kind": "default", "text": "what does \"sin\" apply to: the default, sin(x) / ... (args.defaults)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}, {"kind": "numeric_right", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = sin(x)/x\n  ucas: limit it x -> 0\nlimit of it as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (cos(x))/(1) = lim cos(x)\n  = 1 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}, "isError": false}}
